# a cylinder participant: its drawn x must come from the whole path (d2 draws it with V commands)
shape: sequence_diagram
web: Web app
api: Orders API
bill: Billing
mail: Mailer
db: Orders DB {shape: cylinder}
web -> api.t: POST /orders
api.t -> bill: charge
bill -> mail: receipt
api.t -> db: INSERT order
db -> api.t: ok {style.stroke-dash: 3}
